// IntroString :
"P1570096034" "Ah, {heroname}, good to see you!  I want to show you what you can do with all that salvage you've been collecting. You can do some really interesting and helpful things with all that junk you have.<br><br>There are two kinds of salvage dropped: Base Salvage and Invention Salvage. Base salvage is used to create items for your Supergroups' base, and can used for your advantage during base raids. Invention salvage is something you can use to craft enhancements, you can use these enhancements on yourself or auction them away.<br><br>There are two types of invention salvage dropped: Technology and Magic. These two types will determine what you will be able to invent. Go see my friend Dr. Boram across the way and he'll tell you more about crafting.<br><br><color deepskyblue>There are two types of salvage dropped by enemies when defeated, Base Salvage and Invention Salvage. Base salvage is used to create items for your Supergroups' base; whereas, invention salvage is used to create enhancements for yourself.  You can buy and sell invention salvage and recipes at Consignment Houses in Atlas Park, Kings Row, Steel Canyon, and Talos Island.  The two types of invention salvage that are dropped are Magic and Technology.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P518491016" "Get more information from Dr. Boram."
// SendOffString :
"P2727750797" "Vic won't steer you wrong.  Besides, he's better when it comes to dealing with people."

