// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1040499063" "Hello there, {heroname}. I have some more information about the invention salvage you've been collecting.  I'm glad that you've reached level ten, or trying to craft or slot enhancements would be a waste of time.  Yours and mine. There are three different types of invention salvage that drop: Common, Uncommon and Rare. Common salvage is used in recipes that are found at the universities and your Supergroups' base crafting tables. Ruth Handler will tell you more about the Uncommon and Rare invention salvage later on.<br><br>It's a good thing you're here, because I need your help!  Arachnos operatives have broken into our storage facility and are stealing invention salvage. You must get in there and stop those thieves before they get any more of our supplies.<br><br><color deepskyblue> Invention salvage dropped has three different types rarity: Common, Uncommon and Rare. The Common salvage can be used with the invention tables in the universities and, if your Supergroup's base has one, the invention table.<br><br> Stop the Arachnos looters before they steal all the salvage!</color>"

