// Dialog :
"P2851921606" "So you want to learn how to make invented enhancements, hm?  Good.  Good.  The first thing you're going to have to do is go over to this table<br><img src=COH_Inv_Table.tga> and click on it.<br><br>The invention tables will show you all the common enhancements that you can make.  They only require a small amount of influence to use. Notice how the enhancements will identify their functions in their title.<br><img src=COH_Inv_UI.tga><br><br>Feel free to play around and see what you can make. Make sure that you have room in your inventory for the enhancement, or it won't let you create one. The maximum craft enhancement level that you can create is three levels higher than your current level.<br><img src=COH_Inv_Arrow.tga><br><br>When you decide what enhancement to make, go ahead and talk to Ruth Chandler; she's waiting to tell you more about these invented enhancements.<br><img src=COH_Inv_recipe.tga> <br><br>Oh!  I almost forgot.  If your Supergroup has a base with a workshop room and a crafting table, you are able to create enhancements outside of the university. The process is the same.  Instead of having to be in a certain zone, you can go to your base at any time and make these invented enhancements using your crafting table and invention salvage.<color deepskyblue>Touch the invention table<br><img src=COH_Inv_Table.tga><br>and make an enhancement for yourself.<br><img src=COH_Inv_UI.tga><br><br>Take note of the different kinds of enhancements that you can create and what they do.<br><img src=COH_Inv_Arrow.tga><br><br>Also, make sure that there is room in your enhancement tray, or it won't let you invent the enhancement.<br><img src=COH_Inv_recipe.tga><br><br>Don't forget. If your Supergroup has a base with a workshop room and a crafting table, you may create enhancements outside of the university. The process is the same.  Instead of having to be in a certain zone, you can go to your base at any time and make these invented enhancements using your crafting table and invention salvage.<br><br></color>"

